  "caption": "Cantonese heartland piano-rock band, steady mid-tempo. Acoustic piano playing driving block chords and a right-hand riff, clean electric guitar with light chorus on arpeggios, bass guitar following the kick, live drum kit with a round snare and open hi-hat in the chorus, light organ pad under the choruses. Live band in one room, gently compressed drums, warm piano tone. Male baritone-tenor, earnest and open-throated, chorus lifts a third higher. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 100 BPM, C major. Warm, sheepish, steadily hopeful. No synth lead, no drum machine, no autotune, no rap, no screaming, no heavy distortion.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n每晚送你返到門口\n袋入面，總有粒奶糖\n你剝開，連紙都食埋\n話糯米紙，唔可以浪費\n[Pre-Chorus]\n糖入口，我就轉身\n你關門之前，笑咗一笑\n[Chorus]\n一粒糖，一個晚安\n一百粒糖，一個鐵罐\n我唔識講乜，我識買糖\n你收埋糖紙，等我開口\n[Verse]\n你話：「外面張糖紙，我留低」\n我話：「好，你鍾意就好」\n你將佢攤平，夾入餅乾罐\n唔知點解，我心跳就快\n[Pre-Chorus]\n週末落街，我又買多包\n老闆娘話：「又買？你食唔晒」\n[Chorus]\n一粒糖，一個晚安\n一百粒糖，一個鐵罐\n我唔識講乜，我識買糖\n你收埋糖紙，等我開口\n[Verse]\n今晚你開咗個罐，倒晒喺枱面\n你逐張數，數到第一百\n我企喺度，手心都出汗\n[Bridge]\n你話：「一百個晚安，夠喇」\n「第一百零一個，喺屋企講」\n[Chorus]\n一粒糖，一個晚安\n一百粒糖，一個鐵罐\n你唔使識講乜，你識得數\n我哋今晚，一齊返屋企\n[Outro]\n一百粒奶糖\n夠數喇",
